msgid "Cloudflare IP selection"
msgstr "Cloudflare 优选"

msgid "Finds the fastest Cloudflare IP for proxy nodes behind the Cloudflare CDN and writes it into the selected nodes. The original domain stays as SNI/Host. Every few minutes the current IP is checked; only when it gets slow is a new IP selected."
msgstr "给套了 Cloudflare CDN 的代理节点找最快的 Cloudflare IP，写进勾选的节点，原域名保留为 SNI/Host。每隔几分钟检查当前 IP，只有变慢了才重新优选。"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

msgid "Selection started, see the log below."
msgstr "已开始优选，进度见下方日志。"

msgid "Select now"
msgstr "立即优选"

msgid "Test started, nothing will be changed."
msgstr "已开始测速，不会修改任何节点。"

msgid "Test only"
msgstr "只测速不应用"

msgid "Sources refreshed."
msgstr "IP 来源已更新。"

msgid "Refresh IP sources"
msgstr "更新 IP 来源"

msgid "Put the original domains back into the selected nodes?"
msgstr "把勾选节点的地址改回原域名？"

msgid "Restored."
msgstr "已恢复。"

msgid "Restore domains"
msgstr "恢复域名"

msgid "Nodes"
msgstr "节点"

msgid "Nodes behind the Cloudflare CDN (TLS, a domain as SNI/Host, WebSocket/gRPC/HTTPUpgrade/XHTTP transport, a Cloudflare HTTPS port). Nodes with the same domain share one IP. Only apps that are running are restarted after a change."
msgstr "这里只列出套了 Cloudflare CDN 的节点（TLS、SNI/Host 是域名、传输方式为 WebSocket/gRPC/HTTPUpgrade/XHTTP、端口是 Cloudflare 支持的 HTTPS 端口）。同一域名的节点共用一个 IP。改完后只重启正在运行的插件。"

msgid "Nodes to replace"
msgstr "要替换的节点"

msgid "now"
msgstr "现在"

msgid "Not usable"
msgstr "不能优选"

msgid "Check automatically"
msgstr "自动检查"

msgid "Checks the current IP of every domain. Only checks while the app of the node is running."
msgstr "检查每个域名的当前 IP。节点所在的插件运行时才检查。"

msgid "Check every (minutes)"
msgstr "检查间隔（分钟）"

msgid "Slow above (ms)"
msgstr "变慢阈值（毫秒）"

msgid "Time to first byte through the CDN to the origin. The limit is the larger of this and the score of the last selection × the factor below."
msgstr "经 CDN 到源站的首字节时间。实际阈值取这个值和「上次得分 × 下面的倍数」中较大的一个。"

msgid "Or score × factor"
msgstr "或上次得分的倍数"

msgid "Select again after slow checks in a row"
msgstr "连续变慢几次后重新优选"

msgid "At least between two selections (minutes)"
msgstr "两次优选至少间隔（分钟）"

msgid "Automatic selections per day at most"
msgstr "每天最多自动优选几次"

msgid "IP sources"
msgstr "IP 来源"

msgid "All sources are merged and measured in one cfst run. A source that cannot be downloaded falls back to its last copy."
msgstr "所有来源合并去重后用 cfst 一次测完。下载失败的来源用上次的缓存。"

msgid "Cloudflare ranges"
msgstr "Cloudflare 官方网段"

msgid "Other lists (URL)"
msgstr "其他列表（URL）"

msgid "Text lists of IPs or ranges, one per line. Lines such as \"1.2.3.4:443#HKG\" or CSV are accepted, only the address at the start of the line is used."
msgstr "每行一个 IP 或网段的文本列表。也支持「1.2.3.4:443#HKG」这类格式和 CSV，只取每行开头的地址。"

msgid "Only keep IPs in the Cloudflare ranges"
msgstr "只保留 Cloudflare 官方网段内的 IP"

msgid "Applies to the other lists."
msgstr "只对其他列表生效。"

msgid "At most entries per list"
msgstr "每个列表最多取几条"

msgid "Measure the fastest IPs of earlier selections again"
msgstr "历史上最快的 IP 也一起测"

msgid "Always add the list that comes with cfst"
msgstr "总是加入 cfst 自带列表"

msgid "Used anyway when no other source gives anything."
msgstr "其他来源都拿不到时，无论是否勾选都会用它。"

msgid "Leave out unusable ranges"
msgstr "排除不可用网段"

msgid "Ranges left out"
msgstr "排除的网段"

msgid "Cloudflare ranges that are special-purpose or do not serve proxied sites."
msgstr "Cloudflare 的特殊用途网段，或不承载代理网站的网段。"

msgid "Measuring"
msgstr "测速"

msgid "cfst threads"
msgstr "cfst 线程数"

msgid "cfst latency limit (ms)"
msgstr "cfst 延迟上限（毫秒）"

msgid "Candidates per colo"
msgstr "每个机房取几个候选"

msgid "Candidates at most"
msgstr "最多几个候选"

msgid "Requests per candidate"
msgstr "每个候选测几次"

msgid "Replace only when faster by (%)"
msgstr "快多少才替换（%）"

msgid "Firewall mark that lets the measuring traffic past the transparent proxy. auto: 0xff for PassWall/PassWall2, the self mark of HomeProxy; OpenClash needs none. none: no mark."
msgstr "让测速流量绕过透明代理的防火墙标记。auto：PassWall/PassWall2 用 0xff，HomeProxy 用它的 self mark，OpenClash 不需要；none：不打标记。"

msgid "Log"
msgstr "日志"

msgid "Grant access to Cloudflare IP selection"
msgstr "允许访问 Cloudflare 优选"
